/// Associates one or more member accounts with your organization's
/// management account, enabling centralized implementation of optimization
/// actions across those accounts. Once associated, the management account
/// (or a delegated administrator) can apply recommended actions to the
/// member account. When you associate a member account, its organization
/// rule mode is automatically set to "Any allowed," which permits the
/// management account to create Automation rules that automatically apply
/// actions to that account. If the member account has not previously
/// enabled the Automation feature, the association process automatically
/// enables it. Only the management account or a delegated administrator can
/// perform this action.
